# comments
0100 reset vector: SEI, reset stack, set up ports
0118 PA5 = on/off switch sense; $20 = power state (0x11 off, 0x99 on)
013b compare RAM copy of option bytes with EPROM 1F2E/1F33..1F37 (warm start?)
0169 copy EPROM 1F2E..1F31 -> RAM $2B..$2E ($2E = current channel = lowest channel)
017e copy option bytes 1F33..1F37 -> RAM $2F..$33
018d STOP: wait for wake-up (IRQ)
01e4 builds "ADD $hhll,X; RTS" in RAM $21 and sums $0100-$1FFF; must equal $FF
0248 timer: TDR=$FF, TCR=$0F
026b 1FA9 -> $C8 (selcall timing)
02f0 PA6 = PTT input (inferred)
0301 PA7 = second front input (hook/monitor, inferred)
034c timer reload: TDR=$C5, TCR=$09 -> ~2.4 kHz tick (one tick ~415 us)
0354 PB5 low (synth strobe idle)
0365 16-entry slot table, one slot every 2 ticks
07bd X=2: Rx bytes 0-2, X=5: Tx bytes 3-5 of the channel slot
07d3 bit7 of byte2/5 = entry valid, else carry set = empty channel
07e8 Rx: byte2 bit4 (C/R) -> $1B.5 / $19.2
07f0 Rx: byte2 bit5 (VOTE) handled in chan_flags_rx
07f3 Rx: byte2 bit3 -> latch $2C bit5 (VCO band switch)
07fd bit6 (injection side) -> $29.1
080b synth: port A = 1F2D, PB6 low (enable), 2 strobes
0816 synth: 4 BCD digits, low nibble then high nibble, one PB5 strobe each
0825 synth: digit 5 (byte2/5 | 8)
082b synth: then reference bytes 1F2C, 1F2D; PB6 high
0842 ptr = $1BE0 + 8*A  (into RAM routine at $21: LDA $hhll,X; RTS)
077b bytes 6,7 of slot -> $34 (CTCSS/flags), $35 (link)
0789 byte5 bit3 -> latch $82 bit5 (inverted)
079d byte5 bits4-5 = power; 0 -> operator-selected power from $2C
0926 ADC: select mux via $2A latch, note start time; IRQ (comparator) stores result
093f squelch: pot ($49) -> setting 0-7 via table $0A4C (with hysteresis)
09b8 noise ($45) vs close threshold 1F1C+setting
09d2 noise ($45) vs open threshold 1F14+setting
09c9 squelch tail from table 1F24
0a2d soft timers: $57-$61,$E9,$EA every 64 ticks (~27 ms)
0a51 $63-$65,$EB,$EC every 2304 ticks (~1 s)
0a64 $67 every 24064 ticks (~10 s): Tx timer / auto power-off units
0a76 latch $2C (inverted) -> port A, PB4 strobe: power level, VCO band etc.
0ac4 signature over firmware + 1F65, and 1F33..1F37 + 1F66: must be 0 else halt
0af2 on failure jump to $0189 (power down / stop)
0af5 IRQ = ADC comparator: result = start_time - timer - $1E
0b3e send 2 display digits: $80/$81 + char, $82/$83 + char
0b8f Tx: forward-power ADC ($4A) must lie in window 1F08..1F0F for current power level
0ba6 Rx: $4A < $15 -> supply too low: shut down with alarm on PA4
0bc5 window check: 1F00+x <= A <= 1F01+x
0c21 CTCSS code (byte6 bits0-5) -> tone chip value table $0E56 -> $81
0c30 copy selcall codes 1F67..1F70 -> $CA.., 1F7A..1F83 -> $D4..
0d68 scanning: lists via $53/$54 pointer (1F40 block 1, 1F4C block 2)
0e4d compare noise $45 with open threshold 1F14+squelch setting
0f52 RAM routine LDA list,X  (X=0 priority channel, X=11 count)
0f62 scan list base table: 1F40, 1F4C
0f79 voting: hop round the linked ring (byte7 & $7F)+1, compare RSSI ($46)
0fe6 1FB4 = vote/scan dwell time
1014 1F1B = voting threshold
102d selcall decoder: reads tone digit from $80, compares with 1F8D/1F96/1F9F codes
10c9 selcall encoder: sends digits with timing from 1F70/1F71
13b7 economiser: power-save cycling with times 1FB1/1FB2/1FB3
143d 8-hour auto power off: 1FB5 x 30 min (enabled by 1F35 bit5)
1465 init external peripherals $80-$86
# FM92L-specific (local control head)
=0401 led_latch_task
0422 indicator LEDs: $1D/$1E/$1F -> port A, PB7 strobe (blink time 1F13)
=088d keypad_scan
088d front-panel keys read on port A (DDRA briefly cleared), debounce/repeat 1F10/1F11/1F12
=0548 local_key_dispatch
054f key bits 1,2,8,4 -> function key 0..3 -> 1F58..1F5B
=0b2e display_digits_local
0b4b 2-digit display: low digit on port A, PB0 strobe; high digit PB1 strobe
=034c TIMER_ISR
=0af5 IRQ_ISR
=0100 RESET
